{"version":2,"exportedAt":1774220632304,"story":{"title":"Pancake's Great Syrup Pour","userPrompt":"A baby pancake finding the courage to pour syrup on itself.","authorStyleId":"maurice-sendak","readingLevel":"growing","illustrationStyleId":"soft_watercolor","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Pancake was small. A fresh, new thing. He lived on a plate with many others. All big and gold. But Pancake felt shy. He did not want syrup. It looked dark and strange. What if he did not like it?","illustrationPrompt":"A small, round pancake with wide, worried eyes sits on a large plate surrounded by bigger, golden pancakes. A bottle of syrup looms large in the background. Warm, bright colors. Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774206976618,"durationMs":5730,"retries":0,"promptLength":963,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light golden-yellow, smooth surface pancake, big-expressive deep brown eyes with shy, apprehensive, fearful expression, Slightly uneven shape, A small, hesitant smile, Tiny dark brown eyes, A faint dusting of flour, fluffy build. A large rich golden-brown, slightly crispy edges pancake, average bright blue eyes with indifferent, large in comparison expression, Perfectly round shape, Confident smiles, Slightly thicker than Pancake, Noticeable air bubbles, average build. Pancake looking small and shy on a plate full of larger, golden pancakes. He is looking at a dark pool of syrup with apprehension. in Breakfast table, specifically a plate with pancakes.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition] [variation 2, unique composition] [variation 3, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"The big cakes all laughed. \"Silly Pancake!\" they cried. \"Syrup is the best part! Sweet and warm!\" Pancake hid. He did not like being laughed at. He wished he was brave. Brave enough to try.","illustrationPrompt":"The larger pancakes are drawn with exaggerated, jovial expressions, laughing. Pancake is smaller and partially hidden behind one of the larger cakes. Bright, warm colors. Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774206766007,"durationMs":5221,"retries":0,"promptLength":811,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light golden-yellow, smooth surface pancake, big-expressive deep brown eyes with ashamed, embarrassed, scared expression, Slightly uneven shape, A small, hesitant smile, Tiny dark brown eyes, A faint dusting of flour, fluffy build. A large rich golden-brown, slightly crispy edges pancake, average bright blue eyes with mocking, amused, superior expression, Perfectly round shape, Confident smiles, Slightly thicker than Pancake, Noticeable air bubbles, average build. The big cakes are laughing at Pancake, who is hiding behind one of them. in Breakfast table, pancake plate.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"One day, a crumb spoke. \"Hello, little one!\" he said. \"Why so glum?\" Pancake told him all. About the syrup fear. The big cake laughs. The wish for brave. The crumb was wise and old.","illustrationPrompt":"A tiny crumb, drawn with a kind, grandfatherly face, talks to Pancake. The crumb is small but radiating wisdom. Soft, warm colors. Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774206939344,"durationMs":5589,"retries":0,"promptLength":771,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light gold