ancake felt… tingly! Not bad!","illustrationPrompt":"Pancake is shown rolling slowly towards the syrup. A single drop of syrup is about to land on him. Exaggerate the feeling of anticipation. Bright, warm colors. Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774206923774,"durationMs":4897,"retries":0,"promptLength":661,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light golden-yellow, smooth surface pancake, big-expressive deep brown eyes with nervous, determined, curious expression, Slightly uneven shape, A small, hesitant smile, Tiny dark brown eyes, A faint dusting of flour, fluffy build. Pancake is slowly rolling towards the syrup. A tiny drop of syrup is falling onto his edge. in Breakfast table, moving from the pancake plate towards the syrup.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition] [variation 2, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"He took a bigger breath. Then another. He rolled some more. Now half of him was wet. Sticky and sweet. He smiled a bit. It was… good! Better than he thought. Not scary at all!","illustrationPrompt":"Pancake is now partially covered in syrup, looking surprised and happy. The syrup is glistening. Focus on his change in expression. Bright, warm colors. Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774206720414,"durationMs":5836,"retries":0,"promptLength":553,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light golden-yellow, smooth surface pancake, big-expressive deep brown eyes with pleased, surprised, relieved expression, Slightly uneven shape, A small, hesitant smile, Tiny dark brown eyes, A faint dusting of flour, fluffy build. Pancake has rolled halfway into the syrup and is smiling slightly. in Breakfast table, partially submerged in the syrup.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"The big cakes watched close. They stopped their laughs. They saw Pancake smile. They saw the syrup shine. They felt a bit bad. They had not been kind. Maybe they could try?","illustrationPrompt":"The large pancakes watch Pancake with curiosity and a hint of regret. Their expressions are softer now. Focus on their changing attitudes. Bright, warm colors. Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774206725015,"durationMs":4898,"retries":0,"promptLength":783,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light golden-yellow, smooth surface pancake, big-expressive deep brown eyes with unaware, content expression, Slightly uneven shape, A small, hesitant smile, Tiny dark brown eyes, A faint dusting of flour, fluffy build. A large rich golden-brown, slightly crispy edges pancake, average bright blue eyes with surprised, regretful, curious expression, Perfectly round shape, Confident smiles, Slightly thicker than Pancake, Noticeable air bubbles, average build. The big cakes are watching Pancake with surprised and slightly guilty expressions. in Breakfast table, the pancake plate.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":8,"text":"Pancake kept on going. He rolled and rolled. He poured and poured. Now he was all sticky. All sweet and warm. He felt so proud. He had done it! He was a syrup cake!","illustrationPrompt":"Pancake is now fully covered in syrup, beaming with pride. He is standing tall and confident. Focus on his joy and accomplishment. Bright, warm colors. Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774206726448,"durationMs":6033,"retries":0,"promptLength":542,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light golden-yellow, smooth surface pancake, big-expressive deep brown eyes with proud, happy, confident expression, Slightly uneven shape, A small, hesitant smile, Tiny dark brown eyes, A faint dusting of flour, fluffy build. Pancake is completely covered in syrup and looks proud and happy. in Breakfast table, completely covered in syrup.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":9,"text":"The big cakes cheered. \"Good for you, Pancake!\" they cried. \"We were wrong! Syrup is best with friends!\" They rolled close to him. They poured some syrup too. It was a party!","illustrationPrompt":"The large pancakes are now covered in syrup as well, smiling and cheering for Pancake. Syrup is being poured everywhere in a joyful mess. Bright, warm colors. Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774206845156,"durationMs":4995,"retries":0,"promptLength":849,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small light golden-yellow, smooth surface pancake, big-expressive deep brown eyes with happy, excited expression, Slightly uneven shape, A small, hesitant smile, Tiny dark brown eyes, A faint dusting of flour, fluffy build. A large rich golden-brown, slightly crispy edges pancake, average bright blue eyes with excited, happy, supportive expression, Perfectly round shape, Confident smiles, Slightly thicker than Pancake, Noticeable air bubbles, average build. The big cakes are cheering for Pancake and starting to roll closer to him, some are pouring syrup on themselves. in Breakfast 